[{"id":"jahada-2-218-5","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"i trudili su se","en":"and they strove"},{"bs":"trudi se","en":"he strives"},{"bs":"i bori se protiv njih","en":"and strive against them"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"}],"ref":"2:218","answerWord":"وَجَٰهَدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a62e7a6930ae64efb682.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who believe, and those who emigrate (to escape the persecution) and strive in the way of Allah, these have hope of Allah's mercy. Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَٱلَّذِينَ","هَاجَرُوا۟","وَجَٰهَدُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يَرْجُونَ","رَحْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-29-69-1","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"trudili su se","en":"they strove"},{"bs":"i bori se protiv njih","en":"and strive against them"},{"bs":"trudi se","en":"he strives"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"}],"ref":"29:69","answerWord":"جَٰهَدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/8c4fda709c408c6d2df2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for those who strive in Us, We surely guide them to Our paths, and lo! Allah is with the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","جَٰهَدُوا۟","فِينَا","لَنَهْدِيَنَّهُمْ","سُبُلَنَا","وَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَمَعَ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-5-35-8","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"i trudite se!","en":"and (you all) strive!"},{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"},{"bs":"trudi se!","en":"strive!"},{"bs":"i bori se protiv njih","en":"and strive against them"}],"ref":"5:35","answerWord":"وَجَٰهِدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/9af2c97e88efb4a41dd6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Be mindful of your duty to Allah, and seek the way of approach unto Him, and strive in His way in order that ye may succeed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱبْتَغُوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِ","ٱلْوَسِيلَةَ","وَجَٰهِدُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِهِۦ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-9-44-8","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"i trudili su se","en":"and they strove"},{"bs":"trudi se!","en":"strive!"},{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"}],"ref":"9:44","answerWord":"يُجَٰهِدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/1ce0528f4e86c6432159.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who believe in Allah and the Last Day ask no leave of thee lest they should strive with their wealth and their lives. Allah is Aware of those who keep their duty (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["لَا","يَسْتَـْٔذِنُكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","أَن","يُجَٰهِدُوا۟","بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِٱلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-9-73-2","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"trudi se!","en":"strive!"},{"bs":"i bori se protiv njih","en":"and strive against them"},{"bs":"i trudite se!","en":"and (you all) strive!"},{"bs":"i trudili su se","en":"and they strove"}],"ref":"9:73","answerWord":"جَٰهِدِ","answerSound":"audio/182e9e13cd7efc0b4810.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Prophet! Strive against the disbelievers and the hypocrites! Be harsh with them. Their ultimate abode is hell, a hapless journey's end.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّبِىُّ","جَٰهِدِ","ٱلْكُفَّارَ","وَٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ","وَٱغْلُظْ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَمَأْوَىٰهُمْ","جَهَنَّمُ","وَبِئْسَ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-9-19-11","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"i trudio se","en":"and he/it strove"},{"bs":"trudi se!","en":"strive!"},{"bs":"i trudili su se","en":"and they strove"},{"bs":"i trudite se","en":"and you (all) strive"}],"ref":"9:19","answerWord":"وَجَٰهَدَ","answerSound":"audio/38b0172f9cc168e99abb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Count ye the slaking of a pilgrim's thirst and tendance of the Inviolable Place of Worship as (equal to the worth of) him who believeth in Allah and the Last Day, and striveth in the way of Allah? They are not equal in the sight of Allah. Allah guideth not wrongdoing folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["أَجَعَلْتُمْ","سِقَايَةَ","ٱلْحَآجِّ","وَعِمَارَةَ","ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ","كَمَنْ","ءَامَنَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","وَجَٰهَدَ","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","لَا","يَسْتَوُۥنَ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-25-52-3","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"i bori se protiv njih","en":"and strive against them"},{"bs":"trudi se","en":"he strives"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"i trudili su se","en":"and they strove"}],"ref":"25:52","answerWord":"وَجَٰهِدْهُم","answerSound":"audio/6b931fe9be9c3e20770d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So obey not the disbelievers, but strive against them herewith with a great endeavour.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["فَلَا","تُطِعِ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ","وَجَٰهِدْهُم","بِهِۦ","جِهَادًا","كَبِيرًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-29-6-1","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"trudi se","en":"he strives"},{"bs":"trudili su se","en":"they strove"},{"bs":"i trudite se!","en":"and (you all) strive!"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"}],"ref":"29:6","answerWord":"جَٰهَدَ","answerSound":"audio/2ed6340225e675587a06.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whosoever striveth, striveth only for himself, for lo! Allah is altogether Independent of (His) creatures.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["وَمَن","جَٰهَدَ","فَإِنَّمَا","يُجَٰهِدُ","لِنَفْسِهِۦٓ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَغَنِىٌّ","عَنِ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-29-6-3","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"trudi se","en":"he strives"},{"bs":"i bori se protiv njih","en":"and strive against them"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"i trudite se","en":"and you (all) strive"}],"ref":"29:6","answerWord":"يُجَٰهِدُ","answerSound":"audio/3f1cf9c8529e1fcf12d9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whosoever striveth, striveth only for himself, for lo! Allah is altogether Independent of (His) creatures.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["وَمَن","جَٰهَدَ","فَإِنَّمَا","يُجَٰهِدُ","لِنَفْسِهِۦٓ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَغَنِىٌّ","عَنِ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"jahada-61-11-3","words":["verb:jahada"],"options":[{"bs":"i trudite se","en":"and you (all) strive"},{"bs":"i trudili su se","en":"and they strove"},{"bs":"trude se","en":"they strive"},{"bs":"trudi se!","en":"strive!"}],"ref":"61:11","answerWord":"وَتُجَٰهِدُونَ","answerSound":"audio/8e9ef22804892e6db808.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye should believe in Allah and His messenger, and should strive for the cause of Allah with your wealth and your lives. That is better for you, if ye did but know.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"truditi se, boriti se","en":"to strive, to struggle"},"passage":["تُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَرَسُولِهِۦ","وَتُجَٰهِدُونَ","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","بِأَمْوَٰلِكُمْ","وَأَنفُسِكُمْ","ذَٰلِكُمْ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"جاهَدَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-82-5-3","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"poslala je unaprijed","en":"she/it sent forward"},{"bs":"pripremio je","en":"he/it prepared"},{"bs":"pripremili ste to","en":"you (all) prepared it"},{"bs":"poslali su unaprijed","en":"they sent forward"}],"ref":"82:5","answerWord":"قَدَّمَتْ","answerSound":"audio/e778ba33f61f704898c9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A soul will know what it hath sent before (it) and what left behind.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["عَلِمَتْ","نَفْسٌ","مَّا","قَدَّمَتْ","وَأَخَّرَتْ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-75-13-4","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"pripremio je","en":"he/it prepared"},{"bs":"unaprijed sam poslao","en":"I had sent forward"},{"bs":"pa pošaljite unaprijed!","en":"so (you all) send forward!"},{"bs":"poslali su unaprijed","en":"they sent forward"}],"ref":"75:13","answerWord":"قَدَّمَ","answerSound":"audio/bd6171c51c389fb0951e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On that day man is told the tale of that which he hath sent before and left behind.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["يُنَبَّؤُا۟","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","يَوْمَئِذٍۭ","بِمَا","قَدَّمَ","وَأَخَّرَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-89-24-2","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"unaprijed sam poslao","en":"I had sent forward"},{"bs":"pripremio je","en":"he/it prepared"},{"bs":"pripremili ste","en":"you (all) prepared"},{"bs":"pripremili ste to","en":"you (all) prepared it"}],"ref":"89:24","answerWord":"قَدَّمْتُ","answerSound":"audio/f54d94a38b6a45bdf739.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He will say: Ah, would that I had sent before me (some provision) for my life!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["يَقُولُ","يَٰلَيْتَنِى","قَدَّمْتُ","لِحَيَاتِى"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-2-223-7","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"i pošaljite unaprijed!","en":"and (you all) send forward!"},{"bs":"poslali su unaprijed","en":"they sent forward"},{"bs":"pripremili ste to","en":"you (all) prepared it"},{"bs":"poslala je unaprijed","en":"she/it sent forward"}],"ref":"2:223","answerWord":"وَقَدِّمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/158cb254357d1c23db9b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Your women are a tilth for you (to cultivate) so go to your tilth as ye will, and send (good deeds) before you for your souls, and fear Allah, and know that ye will (one day) meet Him. Give glad tidings to believers, (O Muhammad).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["نِسَآؤُكُمْ","حَرْثٌ","لَّكُمْ","فَأْتُوا۟","حَرْثَكُمْ","أَنَّىٰ","شِئْتُمْ","وَقَدِّمُوا۟","لِأَنفُسِكُمْ","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","أَنَّكُم","مُّلَٰقُوهُ","وَبَشِّرِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-12-48-9","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"pripremili ste","en":"you (all) prepared"},{"bs":"unaprijed sam poslao","en":"I had sent forward"},{"bs":"pripremio je","en":"he/it prepared"},{"bs":"pripremili ste to","en":"you (all) prepared it"}],"ref":"12:48","answerWord":"قَدَّمْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/0fb37999205acde4295c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then after that will come seven hard years which will devour all that ye have prepared for them, save a little of that which ye have stored.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","يَأْتِى","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","ذَٰلِكَ","سَبْعٌ","شِدَادٌ","يَأْكُلْنَ","مَا","قَدَّمْتُمْ","لَهُنَّ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلًا","مِّمَّا","تُحْصِنُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-36-12-6","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"poslali su unaprijed","en":"they sent forward"},{"bs":"pripremili ste","en":"you (all) prepared"},{"bs":"pripremio je","en":"he/it prepared"},{"bs":"pripremili ste to","en":"you (all) prepared it"}],"ref":"36:12","answerWord":"قَدَّمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d1f170468327a7834700.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We it is Who bring the dead to life. We record that which they send before (them, and their footprints. And all things We have kept in a clear Register.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["إِنَّا","نَحْنُ","نُحْىِ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","وَنَكْتُبُ","مَا","قَدَّمُوا۟","وَءَاثَٰرَهُمْ","وَكُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","أَحْصَيْنَٰهُ","فِىٓ","إِمَامٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-38-60-7","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"pripremili ste to","en":"you (all) prepared it"},{"bs":"poslali su unaprijed","en":"they sent forward"},{"bs":"poslala je unaprijed","en":"she/it sent forward"},{"bs":"unaprijed sam poslao","en":"I had sent forward"}],"ref":"38:60","answerWord":"قَدَّمْتُمُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/be33a84361e1103e6f7c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They say: Nay, but you (misleaders), for you there is no word of welcome. Ye prepared this for us (by your misleading). Now hapless is the plight.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","بَلْ","أَنتُمْ","لَا","مَرْحَبًۢا","بِكُمْ","أَنتُمْ","قَدَّمْتُمُوهُ","لَنَا","فَبِئْسَ","ٱلْقَرَارُ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"qaddama-58-12-6","words":["verb:qaddama"],"options":[{"bs":"pa pošaljite unaprijed!","en":"so (you all) send forward!"},{"bs":"pripremili ste","en":"you (all) prepared"},{"bs":"pripremili ste to","en":"you (all) prepared it"},{"bs":"poslali su unaprijed","en":"they sent forward"}],"ref":"58:12","answerWord":"فَقَدِّمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/e937ab227e2c0af24255.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! When ye hold conference with the messenger, offer an alms before your conference. That is better and purer for you. But if ye cannot find (the wherewithal) then lo! Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"unaprijed poslati, ponuditi","en":"to send forward, to present, to offer"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","نَٰجَيْتُمُ","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَقَدِّمُوا۟","بَيْنَ","يَدَىْ","نَجْوَىٰكُمْ","صَدَقَةً","ذَٰلِكَ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","وَأَطْهَرُ","فَإِن","لَّمْ","تَجِدُوا۟","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"قَدَّمَ"}},{"id":"fatana-44-17-1","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušali smo","en":"We tested"},{"bs":"iskušali ste","en":"you (all) tempted"},{"bs":"da ih iskušamo","en":"that We may test them"},{"bs":"zaista te iskušavaju","en":"surely they tempt you"}],"ref":"44:17","answerWord":"فَتَنَّا","answerSound":"audio/ab8bc6c1073ce0b8369f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily We tried before them Pharaoh's folk, when there came unto them a noble messenger,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","فَتَنَّا","قَبْلَهُمْ","قَوْمَ","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَجَآءَهُمْ","رَسُولٌ","كَرِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-9-126-3","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušavani su","en":"they are tested"},{"bs":"progonili su","en":"they persecuted"},{"bs":"iskušali smo","en":"We tested"},{"bs":"i iskušali smo te","en":"and we tested you"}],"ref":"9:126","answerWord":"يُفْتَنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/192fd68074d6e04cb5da.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"See they not that they are tested once or twice in every year? Still they turn not in repentance, neither pay they heed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["أَوَلَا","يَرَوْنَ","أَنَّهُمْ","يُفْتَنُونَ","فِى","كُلِّ","عَامٍ","مَّرَّةً","أَوْ","مَرَّتَيْنِ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يَتُوبُونَ","وَلَا","هُمْ","يَذَّكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-4-101-14","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"progoni vas","en":"he/it persecutes you (all)"},{"bs":"progonili su","en":"they persecuted"},{"bs":"da ih iskušamo","en":"that We may test them"},{"bs":"iskušavaju te","en":"they tempt you"}],"ref":"4:101","answerWord":"يَفْتِنَكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/654318b4a7b53975ac5d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when ye go forth in the land, it is no sin for you to curtail (your) worship if ye fear that those who disbelieve may attack you. In truth the disbelievers are an open enemy to you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","ضَرَبْتُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَلَيْسَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","جُنَاحٌ","أَن","تَقْصُرُوا۟","مِنَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","إِنْ","خِفْتُمْ","أَن","يَفْتِنَكُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ","كَانُوا۟","لَكُمْ","عَدُوًّا","مُّبِينًا"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-10-83-13","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"progoni ih","en":"he/it persecutes them"},{"bs":"iskušavaju te","en":"they tempt you"},{"bs":"iskušavani su","en":"they are tested"},{"bs":"iskušavani ste","en":"you (all) are tested"}],"ref":"10:83","answerWord":"يَفْتِنَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/afe5459886242eaa0786.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But none trusted Moses, save some scions of his people, (and they were) in fear of Pharaoh and their chiefs, that he would persecute them. Lo! Pharaoh was verily a tyrant in the land, and lo! he verily was of the wanton.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["فَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","لِمُوسَىٰٓ","إِلَّا","ذُرِّيَّةٌ","مِّن","قَوْمِهِۦ","عَلَىٰ","خَوْفٍ","مِّن","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَمَلَإِي۟هِمْ","أَن","يَفْتِنَهُمْ","وَإِنَّ","فِرْعَوْنَ","لَعَالٍ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَمِنَ","ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-16-110-8","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"progonjeni su","en":"they were persecuted"},{"bs":"da ih iskušamo","en":"so that we may test them"},{"bs":"i iskušali smo te","en":"and we tested you"},{"bs":"iskušali smo ga","en":"we tested him"}],"ref":"16:110","answerWord":"فُتِنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/8b0cf70f92df966ec513.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then lo! thy Lord - for those who became fugitives after they had been persecuted, and then fought and were steadfast - lo! thy Lord afterward is (for them) indeed Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","لِلَّذِينَ","هَاجَرُوا۟","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","فُتِنُوا۟","ثُمَّ","جَٰهَدُوا۟","وَصَبَرُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهَا","لَغَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-17-73-2","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista te iskušavaju","en":"surely they tempt you"},{"bs":"progonili su","en":"they persecuted"},{"bs":"iskušavani ste","en":"you (all) are tested"},{"bs":"progoni ih","en":"he/it persecutes them"}],"ref":"17:73","answerWord":"لَيَفْتِنُونَكَ","answerSound":"audio/e03793c8140ab38b4590.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they indeed strove hard to beguile thee (Muhammad) away from that wherewith We have inspired thee, that thou shouldst invent other than it against Us; and then would they have accepted thee as a friend.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["وَإِن","كَادُوا۟","لَيَفْتِنُونَكَ","عَنِ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَوْحَيْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","لِتَفْتَرِىَ","عَلَيْنَا","غَيْرَهُۥ","وَإِذًا","لَّٱتَّخَذُوكَ","خَلِيلًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-20-90-8","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušani ste","en":"you (all) were tempted"},{"bs":"progoni ih","en":"he/it persecutes them"},{"bs":"iskušali smo","en":"We tested"},{"bs":"iskušavaju te","en":"they tempt you"}],"ref":"20:90","answerWord":"فُتِنتُم","answerSound":"audio/9d4562bf56334d7d5801.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Aaron indeed had told them beforehand: O my people! Ye are but being seduced therewith, for lo! your Lord is the Beneficent, so follow me and obey my order.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","قَالَ","لَهُمْ","هَٰرُونُ","مِن","قَبْلُ","يَٰقَوْمِ","إِنَّمَا","فُتِنتُم","بِهِۦ","وَإِنَّ","رَبَّكُمُ","ٱلرَّحْمَٰنُ","فَٱتَّبِعُونِى","وَأَطِيعُوٓا۟","أَمْرِى"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-20-131-12","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"da ih iskušamo","en":"so that we may test them"},{"bs":"iskušali smo ga","en":"we tested him"},{"bs":"iskušali ste","en":"you (all) tempted"},{"bs":"iskušavani su","en":"they are tested"}],"ref":"20:131","answerWord":"لِنَفْتِنَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/949c0eb3c76dd80edbe6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And strain not thine eyes toward that which We cause some wedded pairs among them to enjoy, the flower of the life of the world, that We may try them thereby. The provision of thy Lord is better and more lasting.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَمُدَّنَّ","عَيْنَيْكَ","إِلَىٰ","مَا","مَتَّعْنَا","بِهِۦٓ","أَزْوَٰجًا","مِّنْهُمْ","زَهْرَةَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","لِنَفْتِنَهُمْ","فِيهِ","وَرِزْقُ","رَبِّكَ","خَيْرٌ","وَأَبْقَىٰ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-27-47-12","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušavani ste","en":"you (all) are tested"},{"bs":"progonili su","en":"they persecuted"},{"bs":"progonjeni su","en":"they were persecuted"},{"bs":"iskušani ste","en":"you (all) were tempted"}],"ref":"27:47","answerWord":"تُفْتَنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/2852f0826c6c74a244c8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: We augur evil of thee and those with thee. He said: Your evil augury is with Allah. Nay, but ye are folk that are being tested.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","ٱطَّيَّرْنَا","بِكَ","وَبِمَن","مَّعَكَ","قَالَ","طَٰٓئِرُكُمْ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","بَلْ","أَنتُمْ","قَوْمٌ","تُفْتَنُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-57-14-7","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"iskušali ste","en":"you (all) tempted"},{"bs":"iskušali smo ga","en":"we tested him"},{"bs":"zaista te iskušavaju","en":"surely they tempt you"},{"bs":"progonjeni su","en":"they were persecuted"}],"ref":"57:14","answerWord":"فَتَنتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/f232f5c4e360113d2308.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will cry unto them (saying): Were we not with you? They will say: Yea, verily; but ye tempted one another, and hesitated, and doubted, and vain desires beguiled you till the ordinance of Allah came to pass; and the deceiver deceived you concerning Allah;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["يُنَادُونَهُمْ","أَلَمْ","نَكُن","مَّعَكُمْ","قَالُوا۟","بَلَىٰ","وَلَٰكِنَّكُمْ","فَتَنتُمْ","أَنفُسَكُمْ","وَتَرَبَّصْتُمْ","وَٱرْتَبْتُمْ","وَغَرَّتْكُمُ","ٱلْأَمَانِىُّ","حَتَّىٰ","جَآءَ","أَمْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَغَرَّكُم","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلْغَرُورُ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-72-17-0","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"da ih iskušamo","en":"that We may test them"},{"bs":"i iskušali smo te","en":"and we tested you"},{"bs":"progoni vas","en":"he/it persecutes you (all)"},{"bs":"iskušali smo ga","en":"we tested him"}],"ref":"72:17","answerWord":"لِّنَفْتِنَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/0e99e972bb15920a2306.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That We may test them thereby, and whoso turneth away from the remembrance of his Lord; He will thrust him into ever-growing torment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["لِّنَفْتِنَهُمْ","فِيهِ","وَمَن","يُعْرِضْ","عَن","ذِكْرِ","رَبِّهِۦ","يَسْلُكْهُ","عَذَابًا","صَعَدًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"fatana-85-10-2","words":["verb:fatana"],"options":[{"bs":"progonili su","en":"they persecuted"},{"bs":"progoni vas","en":"he/it persecutes you (all)"},{"bs":"zaista te iskušavaju","en":"surely they tempt you"},{"bs":"iskušavani su","en":"they are tested"}],"ref":"85:10","answerWord":"فَتَنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/fd863b511f9b77310dec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! they who persecute believing men and believing women and repent not, theirs verily will be the doom of hell, and theirs the doom of burning.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iskušati, zavesti","en":"to tempt, to test"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","فَتَنُوا۟","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","لَمْ","يَتُوبُوا۟","فَلَهُمْ","عَذَابُ","جَهَنَّمَ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابُ","ٱلْحَرِيقِ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"فَتَنَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-28-40-2","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ih odbacili","en":"so we cast them away"},{"bs":"pa su je odbacili","en":"so they cast it away"},{"bs":"zaista će biti odbačen","en":"surely he/it will be cast away"},{"bs":"odbacio ga je","en":"he/it cast it away"}],"ref":"28:40","answerWord":"فَنَبَذْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/42ad141fcbb73e68e67f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Therefor We seized him and his hosts, and abandoned them unto the sea. Behold the nature of the consequence for evil-doers!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["فَأَخَذْنَٰهُ","وَجُنُودَهُۥ","فَنَبَذْنَٰهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْيَمِّ","فَٱنظُرْ","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-2-100-3","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"odbacio ga je","en":"he/it cast it away"},{"bs":"pa sam je odbacio","en":"so I cast it away"},{"bs":"pa su je odbacili","en":"so they cast it away"},{"bs":"pa odbaci!","en":"so cast away!"}],"ref":"2:100","answerWord":"نَّبَذَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/24bc2c2ac784c776a2ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is it ever so that when they make a covenant a party of them set it aside? The truth is, most of them believe not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["أَوَكُلَّمَا","عَٰهَدُوا۟","عَهْدًا","نَّبَذَهُۥ","فَرِيقٌ","مِّنْهُم","بَلْ","أَكْثَرُهُمْ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-2-101-9","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"odbacio je","en":"he/it cast away"},{"bs":"pa su je odbacili","en":"so they cast it away"},{"bs":"i izbacili smo ga","en":"and We cast him"},{"bs":"pa sam je odbacio","en":"so I cast it away"}],"ref":"2:101","answerWord":"نَبَذَ","answerSound":"audio/87ba6a069e5ae3394572.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when there cometh unto them a messenger from Allah, confirming that which they possess, a party of those who have received the Scripture fling the Scripture of Allah behind their backs as if they knew not,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُمْ","رَسُولٌ","مِّنْ","عِندِ","ٱللَّهِ","مُصَدِّقٌ","لِّمَا","مَعَهُمْ","نَبَذَ","فَرِيقٌ","مِّنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","كِتَٰبَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَرَآءَ","ظُهُورِهِمْ","كَأَنَّهُمْ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-3-187-11","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su je odbacili","en":"so they cast it away"},{"bs":"pa odbaci!","en":"so cast away!"},{"bs":"pa sam je odbacio","en":"so I cast it away"},{"bs":"odbacio je","en":"he/it cast away"}],"ref":"3:187","answerWord":"فَنَبَذُوهُ","answerSound":"audio/ad0ebb36124adcc4ec51.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when Allah laid a charge on those who had received the Scripture (He said): Ye are to expound it to mankind and not to hide it. But they flung it behind their backs and bought thereby a little gain. Verily evil is that which they have gained thereby.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَخَذَ","ٱللَّهُ","مِيثَٰقَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","لَتُبَيِّنُنَّهُۥ","لِلنَّاسِ","وَلَا","تَكْتُمُونَهُۥ","فَنَبَذُوهُ","وَرَآءَ","ظُهُورِهِمْ","وَٱشْتَرَوْا۟","بِهِۦ","ثَمَنًا","قَلِيلًا","فَبِئْسَ","مَا","يَشْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-8-58-5","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa odbaci!","en":"so cast away!"},{"bs":"zaista će biti odbačen","en":"surely he/it will be cast away"},{"bs":"pa smo ih odbacili","en":"so we cast them away"},{"bs":"i izbacili smo ga","en":"and We cast him"}],"ref":"8:58","answerWord":"فَٱنۢبِذْ","answerSound":"audio/9965062b4a5565ce2b2e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if thou fearest treachery from any folk, then throw back to them (their treaty) fairly. Lo! Allah loveth not the treacherous.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["وَإِمَّا","تَخَافَنَّ","مِن","قَوْمٍ","خِيَانَةً","فَٱنۢبِذْ","إِلَيْهِمْ","عَلَىٰ","سَوَآءٍ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْخَآئِنِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-20-96-11","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa sam je odbacio","en":"so I cast it away"},{"bs":"odbacio ga je","en":"he/it cast it away"},{"bs":"i izbacili smo ga","en":"and We cast him"},{"bs":"zaista će biti odbačen","en":"surely he/it will be cast away"}],"ref":"20:96","answerWord":"فَنَبَذْتُهَا","answerSound":"audio/708c7d74b242b7e092cd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: I perceived what they perceive not, so I seized a handful from the footsteps of the messenger, and then threw it in. Thus my soul commended to me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["قَالَ","بَصُرْتُ","بِمَا","لَمْ","يَبْصُرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَقَبَضْتُ","قَبْضَةً","مِّنْ","أَثَرِ","ٱلرَّسُولِ","فَنَبَذْتُهَا","وَكَذَٰلِكَ","سَوَّلَتْ","لِى","نَفْسِى"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-37-145-0","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"i izbacili smo ga","en":"and We cast him"},{"bs":"odbacio ga je","en":"he/it cast it away"},{"bs":"pa su je odbacili","en":"so they cast it away"},{"bs":"pa sam je odbacio","en":"so I cast it away"}],"ref":"37:145","answerWord":"فَنَبَذْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/1748a42aec93e3283d99.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We cast him on a desert shore while he was sick;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["فَنَبَذْنَٰهُ","بِٱلْعَرَآءِ","وَهُوَ","سَقِيمٌ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"nabadha-104-4-1","words":["verb:nabadha"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista će biti odbačen","en":"surely he/it will be cast away"},{"bs":"pa sam je odbacio","en":"so I cast it away"},{"bs":"i izbacili smo ga","en":"and We cast him"},{"bs":"pa su je odbacili","en":"so they cast it away"}],"ref":"104:4","answerWord":"لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ","answerSound":"audio/768a731871c00df9cb4d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but verily he will be flung to the Consuming One.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odbaciti","en":"to cast away, to reject"},"passage":["كَلَّا","لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ","فِى","ٱلْحُطَمَةِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"نَبَذَ"}},{"id":"ghalla-3-161-4","words":["verb:ghalla"],"options":[{"bs":"utajuje","en":"he/it embezzles"},{"bs":"okovana je","en":"she/it was fettered"},{"bs":"pa ga okujte!","en":"so (you all) fetter him!"},{"bs":"utajio je","en":"he/it embezzled"}],"ref":"3:161","answerWord":"يَغُلَّ","answerSound":"audio/ff27b9054b30235d1900.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is not for any prophet to embezzle. Whoso embezzleth will bring what he embezzled with him on the Day of Resurrection. Then every soul will be paid in full what it hath earned; and they will not be wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"utajiti, prisvojiti prevarom","en":"to embezzle, to defraud"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","لِنَبِىٍّ","أَن","يَغُلَّ","وَمَن","يَغْلُلْ","يَأْتِ","بِمَا","غَلَّ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","ثُمَّ","تُوَفَّىٰ","كُلُّ","نَفْسٍ","مَّا","كَسَبَتْ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"غَلَّ"}},{"id":"ghalla-3-161-6","words":["verb:ghalla"],"options":[{"bs":"utajuje","en":"he/it embezzles"},{"bs":"pa ga okujte!","en":"so (you all) fetter him!"},{"bs":"okovana je","en":"she/it was fettered"},{"bs":"utajio je","en":"he/it embezzled"}],"ref":"3:161","answerWord":"يَغْلُلْ","answerSound":"audio/7f5631d357949985c84e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is not for any prophet to embezzle. Whoso embezzleth will bring what he embezzled with him on the Day of Resurrection. Then every soul will be paid in full what it hath earned; and they will not be wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"utajiti, prisvojiti prevarom","en":"to embezzle, to defraud"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","لِنَبِىٍّ","أَن","يَغُلَّ","وَمَن","يَغْلُلْ","يَأْتِ","بِمَا","غَلَّ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","ثُمَّ","تُوَفَّىٰ","كُلُّ","نَفْسٍ","مَّا","كَسَبَتْ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"غَلَّ"}},{"id":"ghalla-3-161-9","words":["verb:ghalla"],"options":[{"bs":"utajio je","en":"he/it embezzled"},{"bs":"utajuje","en":"he/it embezzles"},{"bs":"okovana je","en":"she/it was fettered"},{"bs":"pa ga okujte!","en":"so (you all) fetter him!"}],"ref":"3:161","answerWord":"غَلَّ","answerSound":"audio/f21f193d4123a287e686.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is not for any prophet to embezzle. Whoso embezzleth will bring what he embezzled with him on the Day of Resurrection. Then every soul will be paid in full what it hath earned; and they will not be wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"utajiti, prisvojiti prevarom","en":"to embezzle, to defraud"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","لِنَبِىٍّ","أَن","يَغُلَّ","وَمَن","يَغْلُلْ","يَأْتِ","بِمَا","غَلَّ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","ثُمَّ","تُوَفَّىٰ","كُلُّ","نَفْسٍ","مَّا","كَسَبَتْ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"غَلَّ"}},{"id":"ghalla-69-30-1","words":["verb:ghalla"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga okujte!","en":"so (you all) fetter him!"},{"bs":"utajio je","en":"he/it embezzled"},{"bs":"utajuje","en":"he/it embezzles"},{"bs":"okovana je","en":"she/it was fettered"}],"ref":"69:30","answerWord":"فَغُلُّوهُ","answerSound":"audio/2b82d0c42ba27f36564d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(It will be said): Take him and fetter him","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"utajiti, prisvojiti prevarom","en":"to embezzle, to defraud"},"passage":["خُذُوهُ","فَغُلُّوهُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"غَلَّ"}}]